---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import type { Lang } from '../i18n';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';
const t = (en: string, z: string) => (zh ? z : en);
---
<Base lang={lang} title={t('Array PSF designer', '阵列 PSF 设计器')} wide description={t(
  'Design a MIMO radar antenna layout in your browser and see its virtual array, beam pattern, sidelobes, grating lobes and range-angle point-spread function.',
  '在浏览器里设计 MIMO 雷达的天线布局，看它的虚拟阵列、波束方向图、旁瓣、栅瓣和距离角度点扩散函数。')}>
  <h1>{t('Array PSF designer', '阵列 PSF 设计器')}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{t('Where you put the antennas decides how sharply a radar can see.', '天线摆在哪里，决定了雷达能看得多清楚。')}</p>
  <p>{t(
    'A MIMO radar with M transmitters and N receivers behaves like M×N virtual antennas, each at the sum of a Tx and an Rx position. Their layout sets the point-spread function (PSF): how a single point target smears across angle. Start from a TI board or the 4-chip cascade we use in the lab, or click to place your own. Everything is computed in your browser by direct summation, so any geometry works, not only regular grids.',
    '一台有 M 个发射天线和 N 个接收天线的 MIMO 雷达，相当于 M×N 个虚拟天线，每个虚拟天线的位置是一对发射和接收天线位置之和。它们的布局决定了点扩散函数（PSF），也就是一个点目标在角度上会被抹开多宽。可以从一块 TI 开发板或者我们实验室用的四片级联雷达开始，也可以自己点击摆放。所有计算都在你的浏览器里直接求和完成，所以任何形状都行，不只是规则的网格。')}</p>

  <div class="tool">
    <div class="panel controls" data-frame>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>{t('Array', '阵列')}</legend>
        <label>{t('Start from', '从这里开始')} <select id="preset"></select></label>
        <label>{t('Units', '单位')}
          <select id="unit">
            <option value="half">{t('half-wavelengths (λ/2)', '半波长（λ/2）')}</option>
            <option value="lambda">{t('wavelengths (λ)', '波长（λ）')}</option>
            <option value="mm">{t('millimetres', '毫米')}</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label for="tx">{t('Tx positions, one "x y" per line', '发射天线的位置，每行一个“x y”')}</label>
        <textarea id="tx" rows="5" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
        <label for="rx">{t('Rx positions', '接收天线的位置')}</label>
        <textarea id="rx" rows="5" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
        <label><input type="checkbox" id="merge" checked> {t('Count overlapping virtual elements once', '重合的虚拟单元只算一次')}</label>
        <p class="note" id="errs" role="alert"></p>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>{t('Signal', '信号')}</legend>
        <div class="row">
          <label>{t('Carrier', '载频')} <input type="number" id="f0" min="1" max="300" step="0.25" value="77" style="width:5.5em"> GHz</label>
          <label>{t('Bandwidth', '带宽')} <input type="number" id="bw" min="0.01" max="20" step="0.1" value="4" style="width:5em"> GHz</label>
        </div>
        <label>{t('Window (angle and range)', '窗函数（角度和距离都用）')}
          <select id="win">
            <option value="none">{t('none (uniform)', '不加窗（均匀）')}</option>
            <option value="hann">Hann</option>
            <option value="hamming">Hamming</option>
            <option value="blackman">Blackman</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </fieldset>
      <fieldset>
        <legend>{t('Steering and display', '波束指向和显示')}</legend>
        <label>{t('Steer azimuth', '方位角指向')} <span class="val" data-val="az0">0°</span><input type="range" id="az0" min="-70" max="70" step="1" value="0"></label>
        <label>{t('Steer elevation', '俯仰角指向')} <span class="val" data-val="el0">0°</span><input type="range" id="el0" min="-70" max="70" step="1" value="0"></label>
        <label>{t('Dynamic range', '动态范围')} <span class="val" data-val="dyn">40 dB</span><input type="range" id="dyn" min="10" max="80" step="5" value="40"></label>
      </fieldset>
    </div>

    <div class="stage">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">{t('Layout', '布局')}</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <label>{t('Click on the layout to', '在布局上点击，用来')}
          <select id="click">
            <option value="tx">{t('add a Tx', '添加发射天线')}</option>
            <option value="rx">{t('add an Rx', '添加接收天线')}</option>
            <option value="remove">{t('remove the nearest', '删除最近的天线')}</option>
            <option value="none">{t('do nothing', '什么都不做')}</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
      <svg id="layout" class="plot" role="img" aria-label={t('Antenna layout: filled triangles are transmitters, open circles are receivers, grey dots are virtual elements', '天线布局：实心三角是发射天线，空心圆是接收天线，灰点是虚拟单元')} style="width:100%;cursor:crosshair;margin-top:8px"></svg>
      <p class="note">{zh ? <>▲ 发射 &nbsp; ○ 接收 &nbsp; <span style="opacity:.7">●</span> 虚拟单元。网格：一个单位。</> : <>▲ Tx &nbsp; ○ Rx &nbsp; <span style="opacity:.7">●</span> virtual elements. Grid: one unit.</>}</p>

      <div class="stats" id="stats" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <p class="note" id="msg" aria-live="polite"></p>

      <div class="photos2" style="align-items:start">
        <div>
          <h3>{t('Beam pattern', '波束方向图')}</h3>
          <canvas id="uv" class="pixelated" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1" role="img" aria-label={t('Two-dimensional beam pattern over the visible hemisphere, darker is stronger', '可见半空间上的二维波束方向图，越深越强')}></canvas>
          <p class="note">{t(
            'The whole visible half-space seen from the front, in direction cosines: left–right is azimuth, up–down elevation, the rim is 90°. Darker means stronger.',
            '从正前方看整个可见的半空间，坐标是方向余弦：左右是方位，上下是俯仰，边缘是 90°。颜色越深越强。')}</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>{t('Range × azimuth', '距离 × 方位')}</h3>
          <canvas id="ra" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1" role="img" aria-label={t('Range-azimuth point-spread function, darker is stronger', '距离方位点扩散函数，越深越强')}></canvas>
          <p class="note" id="ralabel"></p>
          <p class="note">{t(
            'Far-field approximation: range and angle separate, so this is the range profile times the azimuth cut.',
            '在远场近似下，距离和角度可以分开，所以这张图是距离像乘以方位切面。')}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3>{t('Cuts through the beam', '波束切面')}</h3>
      <svg id="cuts" class="plot" role="img" aria-label={t('Azimuth and elevation cuts of the beam pattern in decibels', '波束方向图的方位和俯仰切面，单位分贝')} style="width:100%"></svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 data-under>{t('What to look for', '看点')}</h2>
  {zh ? (
    <>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>波束宽度</strong>随孔径变大而变窄：长度为 D 的均匀线阵约为 0.89 λ/D 弧度。级联雷达的 86 单元线阵大约是 1.2°。</li>
        <li><strong>旁瓣</strong>：均匀线阵大约在 −13 dB；加 Hann 或 Hamming 窗能把旁瓣压下去，代价是主瓣变宽。</li>
        <li><strong>栅瓣</strong>在单元间距大于 λ/2 时出现：试试“λ 间距”那个预设，再转动指向。</li>
        <li><strong>俯仰</strong>只来自竖直方向的错开。xWR1843 抬高的 Tx2 带来四个抬高的虚拟单元，级联雷达还多几个。</li>
        <li>虚拟阵列假设目标在远场，并且发射和接收天线的相位中心就在你摆的位置。真实的板子还需要相位校准。</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">第一个版本是我用 Python 写的，用来从一张天线布局的照片读出一个真实 12×16 阵列的 PSF。能画任意阵列方向图的工具，在我的点子罐里放了很久。</p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Beamwidth</strong> shrinks as the aperture grows: about 0.89 λ/D radians for a uniform line of length D. The cascade's 86-element line gives roughly 1.2°.</li>
        <li><strong>Sidelobes</strong>: a uniform line sits near −13 dB; a Hann or Hamming taper pushes them down and widens the main lobe.</li>
        <li><strong>Grating lobes</strong> appear when elements are more than λ/2 apart: try the "λ spacing" preset, and steer it.</li>
        <li><strong>Elevation</strong> comes only from vertical offsets. The xWR1843's raised Tx2 adds four elevated virtual elements; the cascade has a few more.</li>
        <li>The virtual array assumes a far-field target and that the Tx and Rx phase centres are where you put them. Real boards also need phase calibration.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">I wrote the first version in Python to read the PSF of a real 12×16 array from a photo of its antenna layout. A radiation-pattern viewer for any array had been on my ideas list for a while.</p>
    </>
  )}
</Base>
<script>
  import '../scripts/tools/psf';
</script>
